message: "If you use Manakov Lab, please cite this software version."
title: "Manakov Lab"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-12-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cdacostam/ManakovLab"
url: "https://fizmako.com/manakov/"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24406892"
abstract: >-
  Interactive laboratory for the variable-coefficient Manakov system and its Riesz space-fractional
  and Caputo time-fractional variants, with a pure-PHP web application and a NumPy port
  of its numerical core.
keywords: [Manakov system, vector solitons, fractional Schrodinger equation, Caputo derivative,
           split-step Fourier, L1 scheme, PHP, Python]
